  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供字符编码转换、Base64/Hex 编解码、URL 编解码、HTML 实体转义、Unicode 处理等能力。支持 UTF-8/GBK/GB2312/Shift_JIS/EUC-KR 等多种字符集。",
    "en-US": "Character encoding conversion, Base64/Hex encoding, URL encoding, HTML entity escaping, and Unicode handling. Supports UTF-8/GBK/GB2312/Shift_JIS/EUC-KR and more character sets."
  }
